TASK_FAMILY: foundation_document_relevance_v1

WORLD_FACTS:
{{ world_facts_json }}
{% if notes %}
NOTES:
{{ notes }}
{% endif %}

Generate a user query and one candidate document excerpt from a controlled
knowledge world.

Requirements:
- Preserve entity identity, required fact coverage, date/freshness, source
  authority, and whether the document directly answers, partly helps, conflicts,
  or is irrelevant according to WORLD_FACTS.
- Make topical overlap possible without changing factual coverage where a hard
  negative is requested.
- Do not name relevance labels or state whether the document answers the query.
- Return only JSON.

OUTPUT_SCHEMA:
{
  "query": "string",
  "candidate_document": {"title": "string", "date": "string|null", "authority": "string", "text": "string"},
  "query_constraints": ["string"],
  "distractor_tags": ["string"]
}
